<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: I ate from a corpse. It really just isn't the same as live vore.-->
  <RV2_AteCorpse_Predator.stages.0.description>我吃了一具尸体。这真的只是不一样吃人</RV2_AteCorpse_Predator.stages.0.description>
