  <RV2_AteCorpse_Predator.stages.0.label>吃了生的尸体</RV2_AteCorpse_Predator.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: I ate a meal made from the meat of another human. A bit of a waste, but tasty nonetheless.-->
  <RV2_AteHumanlikeMeatAsIngredientCannibal_Predator.stages.0.description>我吃了一份用人肉做的食物。有点浪费，但味道还是不错的。</RV2_AteHumanlikeMeatAsIngredientCannibal_Predator.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: cooked cannibalism-->
  <RV2_AteHumanlikeMeatAsIngredientCannibal_Predator.stages.0.label>烹饪食人</RV2_AteHumanlikeMeatAsIngredientCannibal_Predator.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: I ate a meal made from the meat of another human. What a waste.-->
  <RV2_AteHumanlikeMeatAsIngredient_Predator.stages.0.description>我吃了一份用人肉做的食物。多么浪费啊。</RV2_AteHumanlikeMeatAsIngredient_Predator.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: cooked cannibalism-->
  <RV2_AteHumanlikeMeatAsIngredient_Predator.stages.0.label>烹饪食人</RV2_AteHumanlikeMeatAsIngredient_Predator.stages.0.label>
