  <!--EN: I ate a meal cooked from gray, slimy insect meat. Tasty, but I'd have loved to swallow it raw and wriggling.-->
  <RV2_AteInsectMeatAsIngredient_ChitinChewer.stages.0.description>我吃了一顿由那种灰灰的发粘的虫肉做成的饭。味道不错，但我更喜欢生吃和蠕动。</RV2_AteInsectMeatAsIngredient_ChitinChewer.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: ate cooked insect meat-->
  <RV2_AteInsectMeatAsIngredient_ChitinChewer.stages.0.label>吃了烹饪过的虫肉</RV2_AteInsectMeatAsIngredient_ChitinChewer.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: Delicious insect meat! I wish I could have just swallowed the bugger whole, though.-->
  <RV2_AteInsectMeatDirect_ChitinChewer.stages.0.description>美味的虫肉!不过，我希望我能把这些东西全部吞下。</RV2_AteInsectMeatDirect_ChitinChewer.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: ate insect meat-->
  <RV2_AteInsectMeatDirect_ChitinChewer.stages.0.label>食用虫肉</RV2_AteInsectMeatDirect_ChitinChewer.stages.0.label>
